Chapter: DeskSheetPaneTest
  cites Works chapter GopDesk
  cites Works chapter GopSheet
  cites Sheets chapter CellEval
  cites Foreword chapter CCE

 The wiring of a new pane, which is the half a screenshot cannot tell you
 apart from a pane that is drawn but unreachable. A pane joins the desk
 at named places and every one of them is a separate chance to miss:
 the title, the pill icon, the scancode, the block behind its window
 slot, and the tree arm. A pane wired at four of the five looks finished
 until the one that was missed is the one a person uses.

 THE SCANCODE LINE IS ALSO THE PINNED LINE. `dk-pinned-get` refuses any
 focus id `dk-fid-sc` answers 0 for, so an id with no scancode can never
 be pinned; asserting the scancode is asserting that the pane can hold a
 pill.

 The tree line reads a VALUE out of the built tree rather than counting
 nodes. D2 is `=B2*C2` over 3 and 250, so the cell that must read 750 is
 the one that proves the pane shows the EVALUATOR's answer rather than
 the formula text or an empty grid.

 The sabotage: drop the `desk-wnd-blk` arm and the block line reads 0
 while the title and the tree still stand; point the tree arm at another
 pane's block and the grid line loses its 750.

Section: Body

  dsp-yn : Boolean -> Text
  dsp-yn (v) = if v then "yes" else "NO"

  dsp-cell : Sheet, Results, Integer, Integer -> Text
  dsp-cell (sh) (rs) (r) (c) = eval-cell (sh.sh-prog) rs r c

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console, Device.Port] Nothing = act
    let ds = alloc-zeroed dk-ds-bytes 64
    in let blk = alloc-zeroed 64 64
    in let p = poke-32 ds dk-sheet-cell blk
    in let sh = gsh-demo 0
    in let rs = eval-run (sh.sh-prog)
    in act
      print-line-uni ("title: [" & desk-wnd-title desk-focus-sheet & "]")
      print-line-uni ("pill icon: [" & dk-pill-icon desk-focus-sheet & "]")
      print-line-uni ("scancode: " & show (dk-fid-sc desk-focus-sheet) & "  so it can be pinned: " & dsp-yn (dk-fid-sc desk-focus-sheet /= 0))
      print-line-uni ("focus id " & show desk-focus-sheet & " is within dk-focus-max " & show dk-focus-max & ": " & dsp-yn (desk-focus-sheet <= dk-focus-max))
      print-line-uni ("its block is the one desk-run allocated: " & dsp-yn (desk-wnd-blk desk-focus-sheet ds == blk))
      print-line-uni ("it opens at the content box: " & dsp-yn (dk-wnd-wants-box desk-focus-sheet))
      print-line-uni ("the grid shows the evaluator's answer, D2 = B2*C2 = " & dsp-cell sh rs 1 3)
      print-line-uni ("and the total below it, D4 = SUM(D2:D3) = " & dsp-cell sh rs 3 3)
      print-line-uni ("and a typed refusal reaches the cell: D5 = " & dsp-cell sh rs 4 3)
    end
  end
